<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman on First Virtual.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman on First Virtual.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothess said it initiated coverage of First Virtual Holdings Inc with a buy ratng and a one-year price target of $13-$14 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 9-1/8 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
